     <string name="go_tweak_zram_zstd_summary">Compresses background apps\' memory more tightly, so more fits. It costs more processor time: switching back to apps is slower, and under pressure the system may close apps it would otherwise have kept. Not recommended. Off by default. Takes effect after a restart.</string>
     <string name="go_tweak_gpu_perf_floor_title">GPU performance floor</string>
     <string name="go_tweak_gpu_perf_floor_summary">Keeps the graphics chip at a higher minimum speed while it is drawing, so scrolling and animations start smoothly instead of stuttering on the first frames. No cost while the screen is still; slightly more power during video and other light graphics. On by default. Applies immediately.</string>
