     <string name="go_tweak_battery_saver_cpu_summary">While Battery Saver is on, switches off the four faster processor cores and runs on the four slower ones. Saves power, but the phone feels slower. Does nothing when Battery Saver is off. On by default. Applies immediately.</string>
